# Ascent - messages the commit-msg hook must accept or reject.
#
# A case starts with "=== <accept|reject> <workshop|public|both> <name>" and its
# message runs until the next case. Workshop cases run only in a tree that has
# .publishignore; public cases run in a stand-in repository without it.

=== accept both a header with a scope
fix(plate): keep the summary up while a creature hits a shield

=== accept both a header without a scope
docs: explain how the options pages are laid out

=== accept both a breaking change with its footer
feat(history)!: stop reading saved history older than version 2

BREAKING CHANGE: history saved by 0.1.x is discarded on load.

=== accept both a body and a human co-author
fix(bar): hide the text on a bar too thin to read it

The text is drawn only when the bar is tall enough for the font.

Co-Authored-By: A Person <person@example.com>

=== accept both a header of exactly 72 characters
fix(plate): keep the summary on screen while a creature hits a shieldxxx

=== accept both a merge git wrote
Merge branch 'topic'

=== accept both a revert git wrote
Revert "fix(plate): keep the summary up while a creature hits a shield"

=== accept both a fixup git wrote
fixup! fix(plate): keep the summary up while a creature hits a shield

=== accept both comment lines and the scissors are ignored
fix(bar): hide the text on a bar too thin to read it
# Please enter the commit message for your changes. D12 here is a comment.
# ------------------------ >8 ------------------------
diff --git a/x b/x with D13 below the scissors

=== reject both a prose header
Charge a rested kill once

=== reject both an unknown type
feature(plate): keep the summary up while a creature hits a shield

=== reject both an unknown scope
fix(nonsense): keep the summary up while a creature hits a shield

=== reject both a header of 73 characters
fix(plate): keep the summary on screen while a creature hits a shieldxxxx

=== reject both a summary in uppercase
fix(plate): Keep the summary up while a creature hits a shield

=== reject both a summary with a final period
fix(plate): keep the summary up while a creature hits a shield.

=== reject both no blank line after the header
fix(plate): keep the summary up while a creature hits a shield
The summary hid while nothing had died yet.

=== reject both an assistant co-author
fix(plate): keep the summary up while a creature hits a shield

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus <noreply@anthropic.com>

=== reject both an assistant session link
fix(plate): keep the summary up while a creature hits a shield

https://claude.ai/code/session_example

=== reject workshop a decision id in the body
fix(plate): keep the summary up while a creature hits a shield

The sweep that D89 switched off is back on.

=== reject workshop a task number in the header
fix(plate): finish task 5.2 of the plate

=== accept workshop a Refs trailer
fix(plate): keep the summary up while a creature hits a shield

The sweep that decides whether a pull is quiet runs again.

Refs: add-ascent-example-change 5.2, 5.3

=== accept workshop a Refs trailer without tasks
docs(plan): plan the example change

Refs: add-ascent-example-change

=== accept workshop a workshop scope
docs(plan): mark the desk half of the example change done

=== reject workshop a Refs trailer out of shape
fix(plate): keep the summary up while a creature hits a shield

Refs: see the plan

=== reject public a Refs trailer
fix(plate): keep the summary up while a creature hits a shield

Refs: add-ascent-example-change 5.2

=== reject public a workshop scope
docs(plan): mark the desk half of the example change done

=== reject public a decision id in the body
fix(plate): keep the summary up while a creature hits a shield

The sweep that D89 switched off is back on.
